# Git sync (this project only)

After finishing work here, **always commit and push** to the tracked remote branch. Do not leave completed changes only on Vercel or the working tree.

- Commit when a feature, fix, or config change is done — do not wait to be asked.
- Push to `origin` with `-u` if the branch has no upstream.
- Never commit `.env`, `.env.local`, tokens, or secrets.
- No Cursor / Co-authored-by attribution.
- Never force-push `main`/`master`.
- If commit hooks fail, fix and make a **new** commit (do not amend a rejected one).
